 "Imagine every picture squeezed to a single dot on this table. Noise lives on the left; real pictures of cloth live on the right, indigo adire above, gold kente below.": "56e39ec1b6.mp3",
 "Generating means following a velocity, step by step, from noise to a real picture. A transformer predicts that velocity, told the timestep through adaptive layer norm.": "5fb572d489.mp3",
